<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-06-29T17:09:53.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "panels": [
      {
        "key": "sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-0a1bab27-4756-4958-aee4-1c492920e743",
        "text": "Remember how generative AI can sometimes make up facts out of thin air? It creates stories or details that sound believable, but aren't actually true.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3642286ebc44d4d6eaec3b1f103d0929-sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-panel-1-40c850a0-dfd1-49d6-b84c-3d7d779ceef0.png",
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-ad87789a-29f0-4e9e-912e-6f368fefe559",
        "text": "And the tricky part is, AI can present these made-up facts with *super high confidence*! It doesn't know it's wrong, so it sounds really convincing.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/04c8606d595340dbb3ea178283b2542e-sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-panel-2-1a744a72-0691-4e25-bb06-9aca94859ad5.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-61be5c3d-23a9-461d-b822-5892f36ee43e",
        "text": "AI learns from patterns in the massive amount of data it's trained on. If that data is incomplete, biased, or missing certain perspectives, the AI's answers will reflect those same limitations.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/7b0cc738edb53e81c10cb9a63612422e-sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-panel-3-b7d1dd38-7cb3-4dce-a3c4-238a41f22238.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-2927efab-2cd1-4c65-8423-22ac492e8dc8",
        "text": "It's important to remember: AI doesn't *understand* things in the way humans do. It predicts the most likely next word or pixel based on patterns, not real knowledge or intent.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/97a236832803740eea883f162fa23a71-sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-panel-4-fad0964f-f273-4a0b-a219-6d968fee3425.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "key": "sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-6b79b7fc-8622-42e1-a57b-d16c421f0516",
        "text": "That's why *you* are the most important part of working with AI! Always use your critical thinking, verify information, and guide the AI to make sure it's helpful and accurate.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/334686477b2d81fa8e65f9abe73560ee-sample-aid-sc2-unit-generation-lesson-4-critical-evaluation-summary-panel-5-ea3ecfd9-7f5b-4fb3-96dc-fc239867584f.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-right"
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Summarize the key limitations of generative AI: hallucination, overconfidence, and data dependency. Reinforce the message that AI lacks true understanding or intent and emphasize the importance of critical thinking and human oversight when interacting with AI tools."
  },
  "published": true,
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2026-06-29 17:10:41 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":18603,\"changed_by_email\":\"erik+levelbuilder@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-06-29 17:10:41 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":18603,\"changed_by_email\":\"erik+levelbuilder@code.org\"}]"
}]]></config>
</Panels>
